{'symbol': 'STZ', 'date': '2023-01-30 16:40:00', 'title': 'CONSTELLATION BRANDS PRICES OFFERING OF SENIOR NOTES', 'text': "VICTOR, N.Y., JAN. 30, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CONSTELLATION BRANDS, INC. (NYSE: STZ), A LEADING BEVERAGE ALCOHOL COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT PRICED THE PUBLIC OFFERING OF $500.0 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 5.000%\xa0SENIOR NOTES DUE 2026 (THE “NOTES”) FOR A PUBLIC OFFERING PRICE OF 99.829% OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF THE NOTES. THE NOTES WILL BE SENIOR OBLIGATIONS THAT RANK EQUALLY WITH ALL OF CONSTELLATION'S OTHER SENIOR UNSECURED INDEBTEDNESS."}